{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "xachlgzyyg2r32sh", "title": "4.连接的底层是什么", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u9078346c\" id=\"u9078346c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u762b0387\" id=\"u762b0387\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">连接的底层涉及到TCP/IP协议的底层原理，特别是TCP长连接的保持连接机制。当客户端与服务器建立TCP连接后，双方可以通过TCP协议的keep-alive机制来保持连接，通过发送特殊的数据包（keep-alive探测包）来确认对方是否仍然处于连接状态。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"f6AIV\" id=\"f6AIV\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud8b37410\" id=\"ud8b37410\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">TCP协议的底层实现</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"a5SLZ\" id=\"a5SLZ\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2f8923c\" id=\"ua2f8923c\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">三次握手</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc29da05d\" id=\"uc29da05d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue2c00801\" id=\"ue2c00801\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">第一次握手：客户端向服务端发送包含自身初始序号 x 的同步报文，进入 SYN-SENT 状态。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub2600c98\" id=\"ub2600c98\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7abcd999\" id=\"u7abcd999\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">第二次握手：服务端收到连接请求报文段后，会将连接放入半连接队列中，并向客户端发送包含自身初始序号 y 的同步确认报文，进入 SYN-RECEIVED 状态。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u45c11bc2\" id=\"u45c11bc2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc41c4149\" id=\"uc41c4149\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">第三次握手：客户端收到应答，向服务端发送确认报文，进入 ESTAB-LISHED 状态，此时成功建立长连接。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua7607ba9\" id=\"ua7607ba9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u63f8555c\" id=\"u63f8555c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">这样，连接就建立成功了。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uee07bfdf\" id=\"uee07bfdf\"><span data-lake-id=\"udce689d0\" id=\"udce689d0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2f7f2610\" id=\"u2f7f2610\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F25913951%2F1727598188859-dffda08b-c2af-42e7-87ea-f028c1452f0d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uccf7af3c-0818-4e12-9a47-25faf3c09ae%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uf2c0a2bf-492b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A628.8%2C%22height%22%3A403%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%221727598204359.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A98234%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A786%2C%22originHeight%22%3A504%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACK%3D1%2CSEG%3DX%2B1%2CACK%3DY%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A331%2C%22y%22%3A319%2C%22width%22%3A222%2C%22height%22%3A59%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SYN1ACK1SEGEY.ACKX%2B%22%2C%22x%22%3A292%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A252%2C%22height%22%3A-50%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SYN-SEND%22%2C%22x%22%3A141%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SYN-1.SEGX%22%2C%22x%22%3A367%2C%22y%22%3A149%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LISHEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A157%2C%22y%22%3A422%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CLOSED%22%2C%22x%22%3A151%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A41%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CLOSED%22%2C%22x%22%3A652%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ESTAB-%22%2C%22x%22%3A658%2C%22y%22%3A429%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SYN-RCVD%22%2C%22x%22%3A642%2C%22y%22%3A301%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LISHEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A656%2C%22y%22%3A453%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ESTAB%22%2C%22x%22%3A157%2C%22y%22%3A399%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LISTEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A659%2C%22y%22%3A182%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0065111b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"KTtss\" id=\"KTtss\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda26759d\" id=\"uda26759d\">四次挥手</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uf9d33389\" id=\"uf9d33389\"><span data-lake-id=\"u04a08a69\" id=\"u04a08a69\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">第一次挥手：客户端数据发送完毕，向服务端发送终止报文请求释放连接。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc0527774\" id=\"uc0527774\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4ef2658\" id=\"uf4ef2658\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">第二次挥手：服务器收到连接释放请求，内核会自动发送确认报文，通知应用层释放 TCP 连接，并等待应用进程发送完数据后调用 close() 关闭连接。此时表明客户端到服务端的连接已经释放，不再接受客户端的数据。但因为 TCP 是全双工的，所以服务器仍可以发送数据。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue744afa9\" id=\"ue744afa9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u700666a2\" id=\"u700666a2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">第三次挥手：当服务端数据发送完毕，向客户端发送终止报文，发送连接释放请求，进入 LAST-ACK 状态。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u01fd75d6\" id=\"u01fd75d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue394735e\" id=\"ue394735e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">第四次挥手：客户端收到连接释放请求，向服务器端发送确认报文，此时客户端进入 TIME-WAIT 状态，会等待 2MSL（最长报文段寿命），若期间没有收到服务器端的数据报文，进入 CLOSED 状态。服务器端在收到确认应答后也进入 CLOSED 态。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u90bace5c\" id=\"u90bace5c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub4ba36b0\" id=\"ub4ba36b0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">这样，连接就断开成功了。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u603f768c\" id=\"u603f768c\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F25913951%2F1727598208870-f553b04a-9ca2-44c6-a962-5fc9fbd98061.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5dbe9a2d-17e0-4cc1-9709-9fab0cce012%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uf2c0a2bf-492b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A557.6%2C%22height%22%3A469%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%221727598220810.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A150068%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A697%2C%22originHeight%22%3A586%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%E7%AB%AF%E7%9A%84FIN%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%BA%94%E7%AD%94%22%2C%22x%22%3A218%2C%22y%22%3A469%2C%22width%22%3A256%2C%22height%22%3A70%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%AB%AF%E7%9A%84FIN%E7%9A%84%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%BA%94%E7%AD%94%22%2C%22x%22%3A234%2C%22y%22%3A299%2C%22width%22%3A239%2C%22height%22%3A2%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%96%AD%E5%BC%80%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A288%2C%22y%22%3A388%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A1%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%96%AD%E5%BC%80%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A299%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CLOSEWAIT%22%2C%22x%22%3A550%2C%22y%22%3A223%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FINWAIT1%22%2C%22x%22%3A56%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LASTACK%22%2C%22x%22%3A552%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TIMEWAIT%22%2C%22x%22%3A61%2C%22y%22%3A391%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FINWAIT2%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%E7%AB%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A515%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACK%3DM%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A302%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A3%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACKEN%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A355%2C%22y%22%3A449%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FIN%3DM%22%2C%22x%22%3A341%2C%22y%22%3A134%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FIN-N%22%2C%22x%22%3A317%2C%22y%22%3A344%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CLOSED%22%2C%22x%22%3A561%2C%22y%22%3A496%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACK%3D1%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A302%2C%22y%22%3A436%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%AB%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A148%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f4f0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf71f093d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub05fa863\" id=\"ub05fa863\"><br></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 565, "description": "连接的底层涉及到TCP/IP协议的底层原理，特别是TCP长连接的保持连接机制。当客户端与服务器建立TCP连接后，双方可以通过TCP协议的keep-alive机制来保持连接，通过发送特殊的数据包（keep-alive探测包）来确认对方是否仍然处于连接状态。TCP协议的底层实现三次握手第一次握手：...", "updated_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:18.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:00.000Z", "id": 216261303, "status": 1}